{
  "source_notes": "Compiled 2026-10-06. nu.edu.pk/Program/* roadmaps (current 2023+ codes, checked live and via Wayback 2021-2024) list NO prerequisites for any program. Only official FAST page with a prerequisite column: lhr.nu.edu.pk/fsc/programDetails (BS CS/SE/DS), but it is the pre-2020 scheme with old codes (CS118, CS217, CS218...); mapped to new codes by course name. Blank cells there were treated as 'not stated', not 'none'. BS(CS) is primarily sourced from FAST NCEAC course-description forms (course outlines) for KHI campus batches 2023-2026 in the FAST-NUCES-Hub GitHub repos, plus older outlines (2021-2025) in Syed007Hassan/Fast-Material-CS-SE and arham2003/FAST-NUCES-Material. Outlines are per-instructor/campus and may differ by campus. Empty prerequisites mean either explicitly 'None' in a source or no source found: NO source was found for SL1012, CL1002, SS1018, SS1019, EL1005, SL1014, CL1004, EL2003, CL2001, AL2002, CL2006, SS1015, CS4087, CS4031, MG4011, CS4092, CS2019 (official note: register after 3rd semester), CS4091/CS4001 (old LHR page says 'Sr. Year' standing, not a course). No source states lab corequisites, so all corequisites are empty. Notes/conflicts: EE1005 DLD prereq Applied Physics comes only from KHI Spring'24 outline (old LHR page blank). CS3009 requires CS3004 Software Design and Analysis (on official BS(CS) roadmap, not in Flex Fall-2024 list). EE3009 Computer Architecture sourced from outline coded EE2013 (DLD, COAL). CS2006: KHI Spring'25 says PF & DS, LHR old says DS only. CS3002: outline Fall'22 says CS3001; old LHR CS says 'Sr. Year'; old LHR SE says Software Construction & Development (kept in BS(SE)). BS(SE) and BS(DS) come only from the old-scheme LHR pages mapped to new codes via the current nu.edu.pk roadmaps; treat as lower confidence. BS(AI), BS(CY), BS(EE), BBA: no source with prerequisites found.",
